Package: vayuayan
Type: Package
Title: Air Quality Data from CPCB, OAQ, and WUSTL Satellite PM2.5
Version: 0.2.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mahesh Kumar", "Prajapat", , "22b0433@iitb.ac.in", role = "aut"),
    person("Darakhshan", "Nehal", "darakhshannehal@gmail.com", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Download and analyze air pollution data from three sources.
    CPCB (Central Pollution Control Board) CAAQMS stations provide historical
    and real-time PM2.5, PM10, and AQI readings across 400+ sites in India.
    OAQ (Open Air Quality) aggregates low-cost sensor networks such as
    Airnet, also in India. WUSTL ACAG V5GL04 provides satellite-derived
    PM2.5 at 1 km resolution globally (1998-2022). Includes geospatial
    station matching, AQI categorization, and NetCDF raster extraction
    for arbitrary regions.
